    "id": "Species",
    "slug": "species",
    "title": "Especies",
    "content": "# Especies\n\n  Nanotrasen emplea una variedad de especies sapientes.\n\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobArachnid\" Caption=\"Arácnido\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobDiona\" Caption=\"Diona\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobDwarf\" Caption=\"Enano\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobHuman\" Caption=\"Humano\"/>\n  </Box>\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobMoth\" Caption=\"Persona polilla\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobReptilian\" Caption=\"Reptiliano\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobSlimePerson\" Caption=\"Persona Slime\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobVox\" Caption=\"Vox\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobResomi\" Caption=\"Resomi\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobIPCDummy\" Caption=\"I.P.C.\"/>\n  </Box>\n\n  # Especies específicas de Frontier\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobGoblin\" Caption=\"Goblin\"/>\n  </Box>\n  # Especies específicas de Delta-V\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobVulpkanin\" Caption=\"Vulpkanin\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobFelinid\" Caption=\"Felinid\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobHarpy\" Caption=\"Arpía\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobOni\" Caption=\"Oni\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobChitinid\" Caption=\"Chitinid\"/>\n  </Box>\n\n  # Especies específicas de Monolith\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobProtogen\" Caption=\"Protogen\"/>\n  </Box>\n\n  # Especies específicas de Goobstation\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobTajaran\" Caption=\"Tajaran\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobYowie\" Caption=\"Yowie\"/>\n  </Box>",
