    "title": "Especificaciones de Armas de Misil",
    "content": "# Especificaciones de Armas de Misil\n  Notas:\n  - El alcance de munición y la capacidad de munición se obtienen del cargador estándar y la munición con la que viene cargada el arma.\n  - Para municiones que aceleran con el tiempo (como los misiles), el alcance es una estimación aproximada.\n  - Para municiones que se disparan a velocidad estática (como las armas normales), el alcance es simplemente la velocidad de lanzamiento * tiempo de vida del proyectil.\n  - Las RPS pueden no ser precisas debido a que están limitadas por la velocidad de tick del servidor (normalmente 20 o 30 ticks/segundo).\n  - Las armas raras como los cañones de nave ADS/NT/Syndicate no estarán incluidas.\n\n  ## Especificaciones (a partir del 24-oct-2025)\n  <Table Columns=\"7\">\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box>\n        Nombre\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box>\n        Capacidad de Munición\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box>\n        Cadencia de Fuego\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box>\n        Alcance de Munición (Estimado)\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box>\n        Velocidad Máxima\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box>\n        Clase de Tamaño\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    \n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        ASM-302\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#b58818\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        36 (CART.)\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#5a9926\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        0.8 RPS\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#8f2b65\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        ~945 metros\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#8f2b65\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        210 m/s\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        Medio\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    \n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        ADMP-27 VESPERA\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#b58818\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        84 (CART.)\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#5a9926\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        16 RPS\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#8f2b65\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        ~630 metros\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#8f2b65\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        180 m/s\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        Medio\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    \n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        ADMX-23 TOVEK\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#b58818\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        6 (CART.)\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#5a9926\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        0.2 RPS\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#8f2b65\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        ~812 metros\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#8f2b65\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        125 m/s\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        Medio\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    \n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        ASM-220 (HE TORP)\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#b58818\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        4 (CART.)\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#5a9926\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        0.1 RPS\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#8f2b65\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        ~1747 metros\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox Color=\"#8f2b65\">\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        70 m/s\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n    <ColorBox>\n      <Box HorizontalAlignment=\"Left\" VerticalAlignment=\"Stretch\" Margin=\"2\">\n        Medio\n      </Box>\n    </ColorBox>\n  </Table>",
